             <path d=\"M16.4267 7.5H10.7158L14.19 12.1292L17.1325 9.18667C17.7467 8.56333 17.3067 7.5 16.4267 7.5Z\" fill=\"#6012D0\" />\n                            </svg>\n                          </div>\n                          <div class=\"text-size-medium text-weight-bold game_details\">Rebet mode</div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"body-tab-link_games\">\n                          <div class=\"text-rich_games-tab w-richtext\">\n                            <p>You can play for the same bets as in the previous round by clicking the Rebet button.</p>\n                          </div>\n                        </div>\n                      </div>\n                    </div>\n                                                          <div class=\"tab-link_games w-inline-block w-tab-link\" data-tabbtn=\"1\">\n                      <div fs-cmstabs-element=\"tab-link\" class=\"wrap_tab-link-games\">\n                        <div class=\"header-tab-link_games\">\n                          <div class=\"tab_icon\">\n                            <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 22 22\" fill=\"none\" class=\"icon-1x1-small_game\">\n                              <path opacity=\"0.4\" d=\"M14.19 12.1292L10.7158 7.5H5.57335C4.69335 7.5 4.25335 8.56333 4.87668 9.18667L9.62501 13.935C10.3858 14.6958 11.6233 14.6958 12.3842 13.935L14.19 12.1292Z\" fill=\"#6012D0\" />\n                              <path d=\"M16.4267 7.5H10.7158L14.19 12.1292L17.1325 9.18667C17.7467 8.56333 17.3067 7.5 16.4267 7.5Z\" fill=\"#6012D0\" />\n                            </svg>\n                          </div>\n                          <div class=\"text-size-medium text-weight-bold game_details\">Turbo mode</div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"body-tab-link_games\">\n                          <div class=\"text-rich_games-tab w-richtext\">\n                            <p>For players who enjoy fast gameplay, click the Lightning button to speed up the game. Push the button again to deactivate it.</p>\n                          </div>\n                        </div>\n                      </div>\n                    </div>\n                                                          <div class=\"tab-link_games w-inline-block w-tab-link\" data-tabbtn=\"2\">\n                      <div fs-cmstabs-element=\"tab-link\" class=\"wrap_tab-link-games\">\n                        <div class=\"header-tab-link_games\">\n                          <div class=\"tab_icon\">\n                            <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 22 22\" fill=\"none\" class=\"icon-1x1-small_game\">\n                              <path opacity=\"0.4\" d=\"M14.19 12.1292L10.7158 7.5H5.57335C4.69335 7.5 4.25335 8.56333 4.87668 9.18667L9.62501 13.935C10.3858 14.6958 11.6233 14.6958 12.3842 13.935L14.19 12.1292Z\" fill=\"#6012D0\" />\n                              <path d=\"M16.4267 7.5H10.7158L14.19 12.1292L17.1325 9.18667C17.7467 8.56333 17.3067 7.5 16.4267 7.5Z\" fill=\"#6012D0\" />\n                            </svg>\n                          </div>\n                          <div class=\"text-size-medium text-weight-bold game_details\">Insurance</div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"body-tab-link_games\">\n                          <div class=\"text-rich_games-tab w-richtext\">\n                            <p>Is available at 50% of your stake when the dealer’s first card is an Ace (as it creates the possibility of a blackjack for the dealer). A pop-up with the relevant suggestion appears. You can insure some or all hands. To reject insurance, tap the Skip button.</p>\n                          </div>\n                        </div>\n                      </div>\n                    </div>\n                                                          <div class=\"tab-link_games w-inline-block w-tab-link\" data-tabbtn=\"3\">\n                      <div fs-cmstabs-element=\"tab-link\" class=\"wrap_tab-link-games\">\n                        <div class=\"header-tab-link_games\">\n                          <div class=\"tab_icon\">\n                            <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 22 22\" fill=\"none\" class=\"icon-1x1-small_game\">\n                              <path opacity=\"0.4\" d=\"M14.19 12.1292L10.7158 7.5H5.57335C4.69335 7.5 4.25335 8.56333 4.87668 9.18667L9.62501 13.935C10.3858 14.6958 11.6233 14.6958 12.3842 13.935L14.19 12.1292Z\" fill=\"#6012D0\" />\n                              <path d=\"M16.4267 7.5H10.7158L14.19 12.1292L17.1325 9.18667C17.7467 8.56333 17.3067 7.5 16.4267 7.5Z\" fill=\"#6012D0\" />\n                            </svg>\n                          </div>\n                          <div class=\"text-size-medium text-weight-bold game_details\">Hints</div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"body-tab-link_games\">\n                          <div class=\"text-rich_games-tab w-richtext\">\n                            <p>You can receive strategy assistance by activating the Lightbulb button at the top of the screen. Hints are available for 2-card hands and suggest options such as Stand, Hit, and Split. Push the button again to deactivate Hints.</p>\n                          </div>\n                        </div>\n                      </div>\n                    </div>\n                                                          <div class=\"tab-link_games w-inline-block w-tab-link\" data-tabbtn=\"4\">\n                      <div fs-cmstabs-element=\"tab-link\" class=\"wrap_tab-link-games\">\n                        <div class=\"header-tab-link_games\">\n                          <div class=\"tab_icon\">\n                            <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 22 22\" fill=\"none\" class=\"icon-1x1-small_game\">\n                              <path opacity=\"0.4\" d=\"M14.19 12.1292L10.7158 7.5H5.57335C4.69335 7.5 4.25335 8.56333 4.87668 9.18667L9.62501 13.935C10.3858 14.6958 11.6233 14.6958 12.3842 13.935L14.19 12.1292Z\" fill=\"#6012D0\" />\n                              <path d=\"M16.4267 7.5H10.7158L14.19 12.1292L17.1325 9.18667C17.7467 8.56333 17.3067 7.5 16.4267 7.5Z\" fill=\"#6012D0\" />\n                            </svg>\n                          </div>\n                          <div class=\"text-size-medium text-weight-bold game_details\">Double Down</div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"body-tab-link_games\">\n                          <div class=\"text-rich_games-tab w-richtext\">\n                            <p>Use the button during the playing stage to double your bet and get one more card.</p>\n                          </div>\n                        </div>\n                      </div>\n                    </div>\n                                                          <div class=\"tab-link_games w-inline-block w-tab-link\" data-tabbtn=\"5\">\n                      <div fs-cmstabs-element=\"tab-link\" class=\"wrap_tab-link-games\">\n                        <div class=\"header-tab-link_games\">\n                          <div class=\"tab_icon\">\n                            <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 22 22\" fill=\"none\" class=\"icon-1x1-small_game\">\n                              <path opacity=\"0.4\" d=\"M14.19 12.1292L10.7158 7.5H5.57335C4.69335 7.5 4.25335 8.56333 4.87668 9.18667L9.62501 13.935C10.3858 14.6958 11.6233 14.6958 12.3842 13.935L14.19 12.1292Z\" fill=\"#6012D0\" />\n                              <path d=\"M16.4267 7.5H10.7158L14.19 12.1292L17.1325 9.18667C17.7467 8.56333 17.3067 7.5 16.4267 7.5Z\" fill=\"#6012D0\" />\n                            </svg>\n                          </div>\n                          <div class=\"text-size-medium text-weight-bold game_details\">Split</div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"body-tab-link_games\">\n                          <div class=\"text-rich_games-tab w-richtext\">\n                            <p>The first 2 cards of equal rank can be split. This separates each card into 2 hands and places an additional bet equal to your original one on the second hand. You can not split again if you get 2 more equal cards.</p>\n                          </div>\n                        </div>\n                      </div>\n                    </div>\n                                                          <div class=\"tab-link_games w-inline-block w-tab-link\" data-tabbtn=\"6\">\n                      <div fs-cmstabs-element=\"tab-link\" class=\"wrap_tab-link-games\">\n                        <div class=\"header-tab-link_games\">\n                          <div class=\"tab_icon\">\n                            <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 22 22\" fill=\"none\" class=\"icon-1x1-small_game\">\n                              <path opacity=\"0.4\" d=\"M14.19 12.1292L10.7158 7.5H5.57335C4.69335 7.5 4.25335 8.56333 4.87668 9.18667L9.62501 13.935C10.3858 14.6958 11.6233 14.6958 12.3842 13.935L14.19 12.1292Z\" fill=\"#6012D0\" />\n                              <path d=\"M16.4267 7.5H10.7158L14.19 12.1292L17.1325 9.18667C17.7467 8.56333 17.3067 7.5 16.4267 7.5Z\" fill=\"#6012D0\" />\n                            </svg>\n                          </div>\n                          <div class=\"text-size-medium text-weight-bold game_details\">Multiple hands</div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"body-tab-link_games\">\n                          <div class=\"text-rich_games-tab w-richtext\">\n                            <p>You can have up to 3 hands at once, while the dealer always has one. Each of your hands competes separately against the dealer’s hand.</p>\n                          </div>\n                        </div>\n                      </div>\n                    </div>\n                                                          <div class=\"tab-link_games w-inline-block w-tab-link\" data-tabbtn=\"7\">\n                      <div fs-cmstabs-element=\"tab-link\" class=\"wrap_tab-link-games\">\n                        <div class=\"header-tab-link_games\">\n                          <div class=\"tab_icon\">\n                            <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 22 22\" fill=\"none\" class=\"icon-1x1-small_game\">\n                              <path opacity=\"0.4\" d=\"M14.19 12.1292L10.7158 7.5H5.57335C4.69335 7.5 4.25335 8.56333 4.87668 9.18667L9.62501 13.935C10.3858 14.6958 11.6233 14.6958 12.3842 13.935L14.19 12.1292Z\" fill=\"#6012D0\" />\n                              <path d=\"M16.4267 7.5H10.7158L14.19 12.1292L17.1325 9.18667C17.7467 8.56333 17.3067 7.5 16.4267 7.5Z\" fill=\"#6012D0\" />\n                            </svg>\n                          </div>\n                          <div class=\"text-size-medium text-weight-bold game_details\">Main gameplay</div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"body-tab-link_games\">\n                          <div class=\"text-rich_games-tab w-richtext\">\n                            <p>The goal is to collect up to 6 cards with a face value higher than the banker’s without exceeding 21. If a combination of cards exceeds 21, it&#8217;s called a &#8220;Bust,&#8221; resulting in an instant loss in the round. An Ace can be counted as 1 or 11, depending on which value benefits you the most. If your and the dealer’s hands are of equal value not exceeding 21, it’s a draw/push. If your initial 2 cards are an Ace and a 10-point card (Jack, Queen, or King), you have a blackjack.</p>\n                          </div>\n                        </div>\n                      </div>\n                    </div>\n                                                                </div>\n              <div class=\"tab-content_games w-tab-content\">\n                                                                                                    <div class=\"tab-pane_games-2 w-tab-pane\" data-tab=\"0\">\n                          <div class=\"item_features-tabs w-dyn-item\">\n                                                          <div class=\"video_embed-2 desktop w-embed w-iframe\">\n                                                                                            <iframe data-src=\"https://player.vimeo.com/video/1144532357?autoplay=1&#038;loop=1&#038;autopause=0&#038;muted=1\" class=\"embed_feature lazy-iframe\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\"></iframe>\n                                                         </div>\n                          </div>\n                        </div>\n                                                                                                  <div class=\"tab-pane_games-2 w-tab-pane\" data-tab=\"1\">\n                          <div class=\"item_features-tabs w-dyn-item\">\n                                                          <div class=\"video_embed-2 desktop w-embed w-iframe\">\n                                                                                            <iframe data-src=\"https://player.vimeo.com/video/1144532395?autoplay=1&#038;loop=1&#038;autopause=0&#038;muted=1\" class=\"embed_feature lazy-iframe\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\"></iframe>\n                                                         </div>\n                          </div>\n                        </div>\n                                                                                                  <div class=\"tab-pane_games-2 w-tab-pane\" data-tab=\"2\">\n              