    "responseBody": "{\"success\":true,\"data\":{\"html\":\"\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-index\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-group\\\" id=\\\"glossary-a\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-term-title h2\\\">A<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-posts\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<article class=\\\"glossary-post\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"glossary-post__overlay-link sr-only-stretched\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/acquisition\\\" aria-label=\\\"Acquisition\\\"><\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__title__tax\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__title\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/acquisition\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tAcquisition\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"glossary-post__tax\\\">Marketing and Retention<\\/span>\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__excerpt\\\"><p>In iGaming, acquisition means attracting new players to sign up and start playing on a gambling site. It involves marketing efforts like ads, special offers, and partnerships to bring in fresh users. The goal of acquisition is to grow the player base and increase activity on the platform.<\\/p><\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__more\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"btn--learn-more\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/acquisition\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tLearn more\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t<\\/article>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<article class=\\\"glossary-post\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"glossary-post__overlay-link sr-only-stretched\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/administration-back-office\\\" aria-label=\\\"Administration (Back-Office)\\\"><\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__title__tax\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__title\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/administration-back-office\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tAdministration (Back-Office)\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"glossary-post__tax\\\">Payments and Security<\\/span>\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__excerpt\\\"><p>Administration in the back-office refers to the system and tools used by gambling operators to manage and run the platform. It includes tasks like tracking player activity, setting up games and bonuses, handling payments, and monitoring performance. This area is not visible to players but is key to keeping the site working smoothly and securely.<\\/p><\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__more\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"btn--learn-more\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/administration-back-office\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tLearn more\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t<\\/article>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<article class=\\\"glossary-post\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"glossary-post__overlay-link sr-only-stretched\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/affiliate-marketing\\\" aria-label=\\\"Affiliate marketing\\\"><\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__title__tax\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__title\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/affiliate-marketing\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tAffiliate marketing\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"glossary-post__tax\\\">Marketing and Retention<\\/span>\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__excerpt\\\"><p>Affiliate marketing in iGaming is a way for gambling sites to get new players through partners, called affiliates. Within this casino affiliate program, affiliates promote the casino or sportsbook on their own websites, social media, or other channels. When someone signs up or plays through their link, the affiliate earns a commission. It\\u2019s a performance-based model that helps operators grow their audience while only paying for real results.<\\/p><\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__more\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"btn--learn-more\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/affiliate-marketing\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tLearn more\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t<\\/article>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<article class=\\\"glossary-post\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"glossary-post__overlay-link sr-only-stretched\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/aggregator\\\" aria-label=\\\"Aggregator\\\"><\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__title__tax\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__title\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/aggregator\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tAggregator\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"glossary-post__tax\\\">Basics of IGaming and Business Models<\\/span>\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__excerpt\\\"><p>In online gaming, an aggregator brings together many game studios so their titles can be accessed through one system. It simplifies things by letting operators use games from many providers in one place. Online casino aggregators streamline the process, offering convenience and efficiency in managing game portfolios.<\\/p><\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__more\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"btn--learn-more\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/aggregator\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tLearn more\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t<\\/article>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-group\\\" id=\\\"glossary-b\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-term-title h2\\\">B<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-posts\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<article class=\\\"glossary-post\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"glossary-post__overlay-link sr-only-stretched\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/baccarat\\\" aria-label=\\\"Baccarat\\\"><\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__title__tax\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__title\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/baccarat\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tBaccarat\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"glossary-post__tax\\\">Games and Mechanics<\\/span>\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__excerpt\\\"><p>The popular Baccarat game has players bet on which hand will have a total combination closest to nine: the banker\\u2019s, the player&#039;s, or both. The latter is known as a tie win betting. Baccarat is straightforward and quick-paced, attracting high rollers and beginners equally. The iGaming version offers immersive gameplay with live dealer options and an enhanced classic online casino experience.<\\/p><\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__more\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"btn--learn-more\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/baccarat\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tLearn more\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t<\\/article>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<article class=\\\"glossary-post\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"glossary-post__overlay-link sr-only-stretched\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/bingo\\\" aria-label=\\\"Bingo\\\"><\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__title__tax\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__title\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/bingo\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tBingo\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"glossary-post__tax\\\">Games and Mechanics<\\/span>\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__excerpt\\\"><p>Bingo in iGaming is a virtual version of the classic game whose goal is to mark off numbers on lottery-like cards while they are being randomly drawn. Completing specific number patterns leads to prizes. Online bingo offers social features and various game styles, making it a diverse and interactive experience for players worldwide.<\\/p><\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__more\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"btn--learn-more\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/bingo\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tLearn more\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t<\\/article>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<article class=\\\"glossary-post\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"glossary-post__overlay-link sr-only-stretched\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/bitcoin-casino\\\" aria-label=\\\"Bitcoin casino\\\"><\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__title__tax\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__title\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/bitcoin-casino\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tBitcoin casino\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"glossary-post__tax\\\">Basics of IGaming and Business Models<\\/span>\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__excerpt\\\"><p>A Bitcoin casino is an iGaming platform that recognizes Bitcoin as a primary gambling currency. Such casinos offer safe and fast transactions and enhanced privacy for players. They frequently feature a wide game range, combining traditional casino fun with the benefits of cryptocurrency technology.<\\/p><\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__more\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"btn--learn-more\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/bitcoin-casino\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tLearn more\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t<\\/article>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<article class=\\\"glossary-post\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"glossary-post__overlay-link sr-only-stretched\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/blackjack\\\" aria-label=\\\"Blackjack\\\"><\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__title__tax\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__title\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/blackjack\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tBlackjack\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"glossary-post__tax\\\">Games and Mechanics<\\/span>\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__excerpt\\\"><p>Blackjack is a classic card game where players must beat the dealer by generating a hand value as close to 21 as they can without exceeding the number. Online iGaming versions often include features like live dealers and side bets, enhancing the traditional casino feel with digital convenience.<\\/p><\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__more\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"btn--learn-more\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/blackjack\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tLearn more\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t<\\/article>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<article class=\\\"glossary-post\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"glossary-post__overlay-link sr-only-stretched\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/bonus-abuse\\\" aria-label=\\\"Bonus abuse\\\"><\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__title__tax\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__title\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/bonus-abuse\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tBonus abuse\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"glossary-post__tax\\\">Payments and Security<\\/span>\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__excerpt\\\"><p>Bonus abuse in iGaming refers to the practice where players exploit promotional offers to gain unfair advantages or guaranteed profits. This can include creating multiple accounts or manipulating bonus terms to withdraw winnings without real risk. Casinos implement strict measures to detect and prevent bonus abuse to maintain fair play and protect their business.<\\/p><\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__more\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"btn--learn-more\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/bonus-abuse\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tLearn more\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t<\\/article>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<article class=\\\"glossary-post\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"glossary-post__overlay-link sr-only-stretched\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/bonus-system\\\" aria-label=\\\"Bonus system\\\"><\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__title__tax\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__title\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/bonus-system\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tBonus system\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"glossary-post__tax\\\">Marketing and Retention<\\/span>\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__excerpt\\\"><p>A bonus system is the set of rules and offers that an online casino uses to reward players. It includes things like welcome bonuses, free spins, cashback, and reload deals. The system decides how bonuses are given, what players need to do to get them, and how they can be used. In iGaming, bonus systems helps keep players engaged and encourages continued play.<\\/p><\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__more\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"btn--learn-more\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/bonus-system\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tLearn more\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t<\\/article>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<article class=\\\"glossary-post\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"glossary-post__overlay-link sr-only-stretched\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/bookmaker-or-bookie\\\" aria-label=\\\"Bookmaker (or Bookie)\\\"><\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__title__tax\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__title\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/bookmaker-or-bookie\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tBookmaker (or Bookie)\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"glossary-post__tax\\\">Sport Betting<\\/span>\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__excerpt\\\"><p>A bookmaker or bookie in iGaming is an individual or a company that offers betting services by setting odds and accepting wagers on various events. These platforms manage bets digitally, ensuring balanced markets to secure profits. Whether a person or an organization, bookmakers play a key role in facilitating online sports betting and gambling activities.<\\/p><\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__more\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"btn--learn-more\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/bookmaker-or-bookie\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tLearn more\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t<\\/article>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-group\\\" id=\\\"glossary-c\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-term-title h2\\\">C<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-posts\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<article class=\\\"glossary-post\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"glossary-post__overlay-link sr-only-stretched\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/cash-out\\\" aria-label=\\\"Cash out\\\"><\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__title__tax\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__title\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/cash-out\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tCash out\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"glossary-post__tax\\\">Sport Betting<\\/span>\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__excerpt\\\"><p>The cash out option lets players close their bets early, before the event concludes, enabling them to secure winnings or reduce potential losses. This feature gives bettors more control by allowing payouts tied to the game\\u2019s ongoing progress. It enhances online betting by offering added flexibility and strategic choices.<\\/p><\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__more\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"btn--learn-more\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/cash-out\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tLearn more\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t<\\/article>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<article class=\\\"glossary-post\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"glossary-post__overlay-link sr-only-stretched\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/casino-bonuses\\\" aria-label=\\\"Casino bonuses\\\"><\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__title__tax\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__title\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/casino-bonuses\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tCasino bonuses\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"glossary-post__tax\\\">Bonuses and Promotions<\\/span>\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__excerpt\\\"><p>Casinos often offer players perks like bonus cash, free game rounds, or partial refunds when they register, deposit, or play frequently. Casino bonuses are designed to make the experience better and encourage players to stay active on the site.<\\/p><\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__more\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"btn--learn-more\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/casino-bonuses\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tLearn more\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t<\\/article>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<article class=\\\"glossary-post\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"glossary-post__overlay-link sr-only-stretched\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/casino-crm\\\" aria-label=\\\"Casino CRM\\\"><\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__title__tax\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__title\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/casino-crm\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tCasino CRM\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"glossary-post__tax\\\">Marketing and Retention<\\/span>\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__excerpt\\\"><p>In iGaming, a Casino CRM solution refers to specialized customer relationship management systems designed to track, analyze, and enhance player interactions. These platforms help operators personalize offers, manage retention campaigns, and improve customer support. By using data-driven insights, Casino CRMs boost engagement and foster long-term player loyalty.<\\/p><\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__more\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"btn--learn-more\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/casino-crm\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tLearn more\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t<\\/article>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<article class=\\\"glossary-post\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"glossary-post__overlay-link sr-only-stretched\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/casino-payment-processing\\\" aria-label=\\\"Casino payment processing\\\"><\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__title__tax\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__title\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/casino-payment-processing\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tCasino payment processing\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"glossary-post__tax\\\">Payments and Security<\\/span>\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__excerpt\\\"><p>Casino payment processing takes place when deposits and withdrawals are safely and smoothly distributed between gamers and iGaming platforms. This process accommodates such payment options as digital currencies, e-wallets, and credit cards. Ensuring trustworthy payment transactions is fundamental for building player confidence and delivering smooth gameplay experiences.<\\/p><\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__more\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"btn--learn-more\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/casino-payment-processing\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tLearn more\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t<\\/article>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-group\\\" id=\\\"glossary-d\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-term-title h2\\\">D<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-posts\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<article class=\\\"glossary-post\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"glossary-post__overlay-link sr-only-stretched\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/deposit\\\" aria-label=\\\"Deposit\\\"><\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__title__tax\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__title\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/deposit\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tDeposit\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"glossary-post__tax\\\">Payments and Security<\\/span>\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__excerpt\\\"><p>In iGaming, a deposit is the act of adding funds to a player\\u2019s account to participate in games or place bets. This process supports various payment options like cards, e-wallets, or cryptocurrencies. Deposits are the starting point for engaging in online gambling and accessing casino features.<\\/p><\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__more\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"btn--learn-more\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/deposit\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tLearn more\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t<\\/article>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<article class=\\\"glossary-post\\\">\\n\\t\\t