ithin a specific time window. Deposit limits reinforce responsible gambling by assisting players in controlling their spending, encouraging safer gaming habits and preventing disproportionate losses.<\\/p><\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__more\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"btn--learn-more\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/deposit-limit\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tLearn more\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t<\\/article>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<article class=\\\"glossary-post\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"glossary-post__overlay-link sr-only-stretched\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/drop\\\" aria-label=\\\"Drop\\\"><\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__title__tax\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__title\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/drop\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tDrop\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"glossary-post__tax\\\">Financial Terms and Metrics<\\/span>\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__excerpt\\\"><p>In iGaming, drop refers to the total amount of money players wager or deposit into a casino during a specific period. It represents the gross inflow of funds before any winnings are paid out. Tracking the drop helps operators analyze player activity and overall revenue trends.<\\/p><\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__more\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"btn--learn-more\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/drop\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tLearn more\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t<\\/article>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-group hidden-group\\\" id=\\\"glossary-e\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-term-title h2\\\">E<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-posts\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<article class=\\\"glossary-post\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"glossary-post__overlay-link sr-only-stretched\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/esports\\\" aria-label=\\\"eSports\\\"><\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__title__tax\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__title\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/esports\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\teSports\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"glossary-post__tax\\\">Sport Betting<\\/span>\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__excerpt\\\"><p>Electronic sports, commonly known as eSports, involve players or squads battling in highly popular video games to win rewards and trophies. The rise of betting on eSports competitions has sparked a booming industry, where enthusiasts place wagers on match results similarly to conventional athletic events.<\\/p><\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__more\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"btn--learn-more\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/esports\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tLearn more\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t<\\/article>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-group hidden-group\\\" id=\\\"glossary-f\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-term-title h2\\\">F<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-posts\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<article class=\\\"glossary-post\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"glossary-post__overlay-link sr-only-stretched\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/free-bet\\\" aria-label=\\\"Free bet\\\"><\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__title__tax\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__title\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/free-bet\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tFree bet\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"glossary-post__tax\\\">Bonuses and Promotions<\\/span>\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__excerpt\\\"><p>With a free bet, the sportsbook covers the cost of the player\\u2019s stake. Unlike standard wagers, the risk is covered by the betting site. If the selection wins, only the net profit is typically credited, while the free bet amount is not returned. These offers are often tied to specific terms, such as expiry dates, qualifying odds, or restricted markets. Free bets are often part of marketing campaigns aimed at increasing user activity or attracting new account registrations.<\\/p><\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__more\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"btn--learn-more\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/free-bet\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tLearn more\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t<\\/article>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<article class=\\\"glossary-post\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"glossary-post__overlay-link sr-only-stretched\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/free-spins\\\" aria-label=\\\"Free spins\\\"><\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__title__tax\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__title\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/free-spins\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tFree spins\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"glossary-post__tax\\\">Bonuses and Promotions<\\/span>\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__excerpt\\\"><p>Casinos give free spins as a special offer that lets players spin slot reels for free. Players get to play without risking their own money, but usually, some rules apply, like certain games or limits on cashing out. It\\u2019s a fun way to try new slots and win extra rewards without spending anything.<\\/p><\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__more\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"btn--learn-more\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/free-spins\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tLearn more\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t<\\/article>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-group hidden-group\\\" id=\\\"glossary-g\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-term-title h2\\\">G<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-posts\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<article class=\\\"glossary-post\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"glossary-post__overlay-link sr-only-stretched\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/gambling-addiction\\\" aria-label=\\\"Gambling addiction\\\"><\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__title__tax\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__title\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/gambling-addiction\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tGambling addiction\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"glossary-post__tax\\\">Payments and Security<\\/span>\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__excerpt\\\"><p>Gambling addiction is a behavioral disorder where someone feels a strong, repeated need to gamble, even when it leads to negative effects. This condition can interfere with work, relationships, and financial stability. The person may struggle to stop or cut back, despite knowing the risks. It often involves emotional highs and lows tied to wins and losses, and support from professionals or support groups is often needed to address it.<\\/p><\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__more\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"btn--learn-more\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/gambling-addiction\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tLearn more\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t<\\/article>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<article class=\\\"glossary-post\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"glossary-post__overlay-link sr-only-stretched\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/gambling-commission\\\" aria-label=\\\"Gambling commission\\\"><\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__title__tax\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__title\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/gambling-commission\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tGambling commission\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"glossary-post__tax\\\">Basics of IGaming and Business Models<\\/span>\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__excerpt\\\"><p>A gambling commission functions as a regulatory body responsible for controlling and supervising legal gambling within a specific area. Its duties include licensing operators, setting compliance standards, and investigating misconduct. By enforcing regulations and ensuring transparency, the commission plays a key role in protecting the public, minimizing risks, and upholding fairness across all gambling platforms and services.<\\/p><\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__more\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"btn--learn-more\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/gambling-commission\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tLearn more\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t<\\/article>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<article class=\\\"glossary-post\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"glossary-post__overlay-link sr-only-stretched\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/gambling-jurisdiction\\\" aria-label=\\\"Gambling jurisdiction\\\"><\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__title__tax\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__title\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/gambling-jurisdiction\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tGambling jurisdiction\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"glossary-post__tax\\\">Basics of IGaming and Business Models<\\/span>\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__excerpt\\\"><p>A gambling jurisdiction is a legal territory \\u2014 such as a country or region \\u2014 that defines how gambling is governed within its borders. It establishes the legal framework for licensing, operational conduct, and player safeguards. Each jurisdiction sets its own standards, which can vary widely. Knowing the licensing authority behind a gambling site helps assess its credibility, accountability, and legal compliance.<\\/p><\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__more\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"btn--learn-more\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/gambling-jurisdiction\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tLearn more\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t<\\/article>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<article class=\\\"glossary-post\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"glossary-post__overlay-link sr-only-stretched\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/gambling-liability\\\" aria-label=\\\"Gambling liability\\\"><\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__title__tax\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__title\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/gambling-liability\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tGambling liability\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"glossary-post__tax\\\">Financial Terms and Metrics<\\/span>\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__excerpt\\\"><p>Gambling liability represents the potential financial exposure an operator faces from unsettled bets, essentially, the maximum amount it may owe if all active wagers result in wins. This figure reflects real-time risk tied to ongoing games or events. Accurate tracking and control of liability are essential for maintaining financial stability, ensuring that all player payouts can be honored without disruption.<\\/p><\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__more\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"btn--learn-more\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/gambling-liability\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tLearn more\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t<\\/article>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<article class=\\\"glossary-post\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"glossary-post__overlay-link sr-only-stretched\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/gambling-licence\\\" aria-label=\\\"Gambling licence\\\"><\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__title__tax\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__title\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/gambling-licence\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tGambling licence\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"glossary-post__tax\\\">Basics of IGaming and Business Models<\\/span>\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__excerpt\\\"><p>A gambling licence is a formal authorization issued by a recognized regulatory body, granting an operator the legal right to run gambling services. To obtain it, the operator must comply with strict criteria related to fairness, data security, and responsible conduct. This licence serves as proof that the operator is subject to oversight, ensuring the games are legal and players are treated fairly.<\\/p><\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__more\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"btn--learn-more\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/gambling-licence\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tLearn more\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t<\\/article>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<article class=\\\"glossary-post\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"glossary-post__overlay-link sr-only-stretched\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/gambling-operator\\\" aria-label=\\\"Gambling operator\\\"><\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__title__tax\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__title\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/gambling-operator\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tGambling operator\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"glossary-post__tax\\\">Basics of IGaming and Business Models<\\/span>\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__excerpt\\\"><p>A gambling operator is an entity responsible for delivering and maintaining gambling content, services, and solutions, whether online or in physical venues. This covers following legal and tech rules, managing user accounts, handling payments, and running the game platform. iGaming operators are the central force behind the gaming experience, balancing entertainment, trustworthy mechanisms, and regulatory obligations.<\\/p><\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__more\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"btn--learn-more\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/gambling-operator\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tLearn more\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t<\\/article>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<article class=\\\"glossary-post\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"glossary-post__overlay-link sr-only-stretched\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/gambling-software-provider\\\" aria-label=\\\"Gambling software provider\\\"><\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__title__tax\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__title\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/gambling-software-provider\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tGambling software provider\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"glossary-post__tax\\\">Basics of IGaming and Business Models<\\/span>\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__excerpt\\\"><p>A gambling software provider develops the digital tools and gaming content used for online betting and casino play. They develop everything from slot titles and live games to the systems that track actions and handle money. Such providers play a major part in ensuring everything works right, stays secure, and follows the law.<\\/p><\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__more\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"btn--learn-more\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/gambling-software-provider\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tLearn more\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t<\\/article>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<article class=\\\"glossary-post hidden-post\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"glossary-post__overlay-link sr-only-stretched\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/game-portfolio\\\" aria-label=\\\"Game portfolio\\\"><\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__title__tax\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__title\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/game-portfolio\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tGame portfolio\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"glossary-post__tax\\\">Basics of IGaming and Business Models<\\/span>\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__excerpt\\\"><p>A game portfolio is the complete set of gambling games a casino platform offers. This assortment may span video slots, card and table games, live casino streams, and in some cases, virtual sports. The structure and mixture of a casino\\u2019s portfolio influence user engagement, catering to different tastes and enhancing replay value through broad gameplay options.<\\/p><\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__more\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"btn--learn-more\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/game-portfolio\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tLearn more\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t<\\/article>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<article class=\\\"glossary-post hidden-post\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"glossary-post__overlay-link sr-only-stretched\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/game-provider\\\" aria-label=\\\"Game provider\\\"><\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__title__tax\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__title\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/game-provider\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tGame provider\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"glossary-post__tax\\\">Basics of IGaming and Business Models<\\/span>\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__excerpt\\\"><p>A game provider designs and delivers interactive casino games for use on gambling websites. These companies craft a range of titles, such as card games, slot machines, and real-time dealer experiences, and supply them under licensing agreements. The reputation and technical aspects of game providers directly influence the entertainment quality, fairness, and reliability of online gaming platforms\\u2019 offerings.<\\/p><\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__more\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"btn--learn-more\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/game-provider\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tLearn more\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t<\\/article>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<article class=\\\"glossary-post hidden-post\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"glossary-post__overlay-link sr-only-stretched\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/gamification\\\" aria-label=\\\"Gamification\\\"><\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__title__tax\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__title\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/gamification\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tGamification\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"glossary-post__tax\\\">Marketing and Retention<\\/span>\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__excerpt\\\"><p>Gamification involves integrating elements typical of games, like achievement badges, progress tracking, and competitive challenges, into online casino experiences. This approach transforms traditional gambling by adding layers of motivation and interaction, encouraging players to engage more deeply and consistently. Rather than focusing solely on monetary wins, gamification introduces additional incentives that enhance entertainment and player loyalty.<\\/p><\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__more\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"btn--learn-more\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/gamification\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tLearn more\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t<\\/article>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<article class=\\\"glossary-post hidden-post\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"glossary-post__overlay-link sr-only-stretched\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/gross-gaming-revenue-ggr\\\" aria-label=\\\"Gross Gaming Revenue (GGR)\\\"><\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__title__tax\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__title\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/gross-gaming-revenue-ggr\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tGross Gaming Revenue (GGR)\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"glossary-post__tax\\\">Financial Terms and Metrics<\\/span>\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__excerpt\\\"><p>Gross Gaming Revenue, or GGR, is the total amount a gambling operator earns from player bets before any costs are taken out. It\\u2019s calculated by subtracting all player winnings from the total amount wagered. GGR shows the raw income from gaming activity, not counting things like bonuses, fees, or taxes.<\\/p><\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__more\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"btn--learn-more\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/gross-gaming-revenue-ggr\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tLearn more\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t<\\/article>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<button class=\\\"btn load-more-btn\\\" data-total=\\\"11\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tSHOW MORE\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/button>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-group hidden-group\\\" id=\\\"glossary-h\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-term-title h2\\\">H<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-posts\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<article class=\\\"glossary-post\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"glossary-post__overlay-link sr-only-stretched\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/high-roller\\\" aria-label=\\\"High roller\\\"><\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__title__tax\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__title\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/high-roller\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tHigh roller\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"glossary-post__tax\\\">Players and Their Behavior<\\/span>\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__excerpt\\\"><p>A high roller is a gambler known for placing significantly larger wagers than typical players. Due to their substantial betting activity, casinos often provide them with premium perks like enhanced bonuses, VIP access, and tailored customer care. While high rollers accept greater financial risks, their potential for substantial returns far exceeds that of average bettors, making them valuable clients in the gambling ecosystem.<\\/p><\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__more\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"btn--learn-more\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/high-roller\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tLearn more\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t<\\/article>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-group hidden-group\\\" id=\\\"glossary-i\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-term-title h2\\\">I<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-posts\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<article class=\\\"glossary-post\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"glossary-post__overlay-link sr-only-stretched\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/igaming\\\" aria-label=\\\"iGaming\\\"><\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__title__tax\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__title\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/igaming\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tiGaming\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"glossary-post__tax\\\">Basics of IGaming and Business Models<\\/span>\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__excerpt\\\"><p>iGaming is a form of entertainment where users can gamble online, whether they\\u2019re spinning a slot, playing poker, or betting on a match. By enabling gameplay via computers and mobile devices, iGaming makes it possible to bet and play games without leaving home, offering players flexible access and a broad spectrum of entertainment choices anytime and anywhere.<\\/p><\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__more\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"btn--learn-more\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/igaming\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tLearn more\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t<\\/article>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-group hidden-group\\\" id=\\\"glossary-j\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-term-title h2\\\">J<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-posts\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<article class=\\\"glossary-post\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"glossary-post__overlay-link sr-only-stretched\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/jackpot\\\" aria-label=\\\"Jackpot\\\"><\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__title__tax\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__title\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/jackpot\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tJackpot\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"glossary-post__tax\\\">Games and Mechanics<\\/span>\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__excerpt\\\"><p>A jackpot is the top prize in a casino game, usually much larger than regular winnings. It\\u2019s often triggered by hitting a rare combination or reaching a certain point in the game. Some jackpots are fixed amounts, while others, known as progressive jackpots, grow over time as more people play. Winning a jackpot means getting the biggest possible payout from that game.<\\/p><\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__more\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"btn--learn-more\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/jackpot\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tLearn more\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t<\\/article>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-group hidden-group\\\" id=\\\"glossary-k\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-term-title h2\\\">K<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-posts\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<article class=\\\"glossary-post\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"glossary-post__overlay-link sr-only-stretched\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/key-performance-indicator-kpi\\\" aria-label=\\\"Key performance indicator (KPI)\\\"><\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__title__tax\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__title\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/key-performance-indicator-kpi\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tKey performance indicator (KPI)\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"glossary-post__tax\\\">Financial Terms and Metrics<\\/span>\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__excerpt\\\"><p>KPI stands for key performance indicator. In iGaming, it\\u2019s a number or measurement used to track how well a casino or betting site is doing. Common KPIs include things like number of new players, average bet size, or how often users come back. These indicators help operators understand what\\u2019s working and what needs improvement.<\\/p><\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__more\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"btn--learn-more\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/key-performance-indicator-kpi\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tLearn more\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t<\\/article>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<article class=\\\"glossary-post\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"glossary-post__overlay-link sr-only-stretched\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/know-your-customer-kyc\\\" aria-label=\\\"Know your customer (KYC)\\\"><\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__title__tax\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__title\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/know-your-customer-kyc\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tKnow your customer (KYC)\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"glossary-post__tax\\\">Payments and Security<\\/span>\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__excerpt\\\"><p>KYC in iGaming is the procedure used to verify the identity of players before they access services. It helps safeguard against fraud, underage users, and illegal activities like money laundering. Typically, players submit personal documents such as ID and address proof. This process is legally required in many markets. KYC also encourages a secure and fair gaming environment.<\\/p><\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__more\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"btn--learn-more\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/know-your-customer-kyc\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tLearn more\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t<\\/article>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-group hidden-group\\\" id=\\\"glossary-l\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-term-title h2\\\">L<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-posts\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<article class=\\\"glossary-post\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"glossary-post__overlay-link sr-only-stretched\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/licensing-authority\\\" aria-label=\\\"Licensing authority\\\"><\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__title__tax\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__title\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/licensing-authority\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tLicensing authority\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"glossary-post__tax\\\">Basics of IGaming and Business Models<\\/span>\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__excerpt\\\"><p>A licensing authority is a government or regulatory organization that authorizes iGaming companies to operate legally. It enforces rigorous requirements related to fairness, player safety, and ethical handling. By making sure regulations are met, it helps build trust and keeps users safe.<\\/p><\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__more\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"btn--learn-more\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/licensing-authority\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tLearn more\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t<\\/article>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<article class=\\\"glossary-post\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"glossary-post__overlay-link sr-only-stretched\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/live-casino-games\\\" aria-label=\\\"Live casino games\\\"><\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__title__tax\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__title\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/live-casino-games\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tLive casino games\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"glossary-post__tax\\\">Games and Mechanics<\\/span>\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__excerpt\\\"><p>Live casino games create opportunities to connect players with dealers via live video streaming. Such games unite the accessibility of online gambling with the authentic vibe of land-based casinos. Players can engage in the gameplay of popular titles such as roulette, baccarat, and others, in real time having a more engaging social gaming experience.<\\/p><\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__more\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"btn--learn-more\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/live-casino-games\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tLearn more\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t<\\/article>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<article class=\\\"glossary-post\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"glossary-post__overlay-link sr-only-stretched\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/lotto\\\" aria-label=\\\"Lotto\\\"><\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__title__tax\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__title\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/lotto\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tLotto\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"glossary-post__tax\\\">Games and Mechanics<\\/span>\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__excerpt\\\"><p>Lotto is an online adaptation of the classic lottery game where participants buy tickets with randomly assigned numbers hoping to win rewards. Drawings of numbers occur at set intervals, with winners decided based on the matching numbers on their cards. This game provides an easy, luck-driven experience available on digital platforms, often with varying jackpot amounts.<\\/p><\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__more\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"btn--learn-more\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/lotto\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tLearn more\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t<\\/article>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-group hidden-group\\\" id=\\\"glossary-m\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-term-title h2\\\">M<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-posts\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<article class=\\\"glossary-post\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"glossary-post__overlay-link sr-only-stretched\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/max-bet\\\" aria-label=\\\"Max bet\\\"><\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__title__tax\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__title\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/max-bet\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tMax bet\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"glossary-post__tax\\\">Financial Terms and Metrics<\\/span>\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__excerpt\\\"><p>The max bet value represents the highest amount players are allowed to wager during a single round or spin. Game creators or casinos themselves set this limit to account for potential risks and payout caps. To reach all bonus levels or win the biggest rewards, players may need to bet the maximum amount in certain games.<\\/p><\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__more\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"btn--learn-more\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/max-bet\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tLearn more\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t<\\/article>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<article class=\\\"glossary-post\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"glossary-post__overlay-link sr-only-stretched\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/money-laundering\\\" aria-label=\\\"Money laundering\\\"><\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__title__tax\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__title\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/money-laundering\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tMoney laundering\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"glossary-post__tax\\\">Payments and Security<\\/span>\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__excerpt\\\"><p>Money laundering in iGaming refers to the process of concealing illegally acquired money by funneling it through online gambling sites. Offenders use this tactic to legitimize illicit funds by wagering and then cashing out winnings. To combat this, regulators enforce strict controls to identify and stop such practices, maintaining transparency and security within the industry.<\\/p><\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__more\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"btn--learn-more\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/money-laundering\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tLearn more\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t<\\/article>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<article class=\\\"glossary-post\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"glossary-post__overlay-link sr-only-stretched\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/multiplier\\\" aria-label=\\\"Multiplier\\\"><\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__title__tax\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__title\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/multiplier\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tMultiplier\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"glossary-post__tax\\\">Games and Mechanics<\\/span>\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__excerpt\\\"><p>In iGaming, a multiplier is a feature that increases the value of a player&#039;s winnings by a specific factor. When activated, it boosts payouts, often during bonus rounds or special game events. Multipliers enhance excitement by offering the chance for larger rewards without additional bets.<\\/p><\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__more\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"btn--learn-more\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/multiplier\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tLearn more\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t<\\/article>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-group hidden-group\\\" id=\\\"glossary-n\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-term-title h2\\\">N<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-posts\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<article class=\\\"glossary-post\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"glossary-post__overlay-link sr-only-stretched\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/net-gaming-revenue-ngr\\\" aria-label=\\\"Net Gaming Revenue (NGR)\\\"><\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__title__tax\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__title\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/net-gaming-revenue-ngr\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tNet Gaming Revenue (NGR)\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"glossary-post__tax\\\">Financial Terms and Metrics<\\/span>\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__excerpt\\\"><p>Net Gaming Revenue, or NGR, is the total money a gambling site keeps after paying out all winnings and bonuses. It\\u2019s the amount left from player bets once prizes and offers are deducted. NGR shows how much the operator actually earns from the games before other expenses are taken into account.<\\/p><\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__more\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"btn--learn-more\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/net-gaming-revenue-ngr\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tLearn more\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t<\\/article>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<article class=\\\"glossary-post\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"glossary-post__overlay-link sr-only-stretched\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/no-deposit-bonus\\\" aria-label=\\\"No-deposit bonus\\\"><\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__title__tax\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__title\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/no-deposit-bonus\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tNo-deposit bonus\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"glossary-post__tax\\\">Bonuses and Promotions<\\/span>\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__excerpt\\\"><p>With a no-deposit bonus, players get free access to casino games without adding money to their account, giving them a chance to win without any cost.<\\/p><\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__more\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"btn--learn-more\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/no-deposit-bonus\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tLearn more\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t<\\/article>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<article class=\\\"glossary-post\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"glossary-post__overlay-link sr-only-stretched\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/non-sticky-bonus\\\" aria-label=\\\"Non-sticky bonus\\\"><\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__title__tax\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__title\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/non-sticky-bonus\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tNon-sticky bonus\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"glossary-post__tax\\\">Bonuses and Promotions<\\/span>\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__excerpt\\\"><p>A non-sticky bonus allows players to use their deposited money first, with no strings attached. The bonus remains separate and only comes into play if the initial funds are fully used.<\\/p><\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__more\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"btn--learn-more\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/non-sticky-bonus\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tLearn more\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t<\\/article>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-group hidden-group\\\" id=\\\"glossary-o\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-term-title h2\\\">O<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-posts\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<article class=\\\"glossary-post\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"glossary-post__overlay-link sr-only-stretched\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/online-casino\\\" aria-label=\\\"Online casino\\\"><\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__title__tax\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__title\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/online-casino\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tOnline casino\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"glossary-post__tax\\\">Basics of IGaming and Business Models<\\/span>\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__excerpt\\\"><p>Through an online casino, players can enjoy various gambling games digitally, including slots, Plinko, and other games, with the freedom to play anytime.<\\/p><\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__more\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"btn--learn-more\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/online-casino\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tLearn more\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t<\\/article>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<article class=\\\"glossary-post\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"glossary-post__overlay-link sr-only-stretched\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/overlay\\\" aria-label=\\\"Overlay\\\"><\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__title__tax\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__title\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/overlay\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tOverlay\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"glossary-post__tax\\\">Financial Terms and Metrics<\\/span>\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__excerpt\\\"><p>In iGaming, an overlay happens when a guaranteed prize pool in a tournament isn\\u2019t fully covered by player entries. This means the casino covers the shortfall, giving players extra value.<\\/p><\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__more\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"btn--learn-more\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/overlay\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tLearn more\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t<\\/article>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-group hidden-group\\\" id=\\\"glossary-p\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-term-title h2\\\">P<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-posts\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<article class=\\\"glossary-post\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"glossary-post__overlay-link sr-only-stretched\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/pay-table\\\" aria-label=\\\"Pay table\\\"><\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__title__tax\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__title\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/pay-table\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tPay table\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"glossary-post__tax\\\">Games and Mechanics<\\/span>\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__excerpt\\\"><p>A pay table shows the payouts for different winning combinations in a game. It explains how much you can win based on the symbols, bets, and bonus features.<\\/p><\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__more\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"btn--learn-more\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/pay-table\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tLearn more\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t<\\/article>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<article class=\\\"glossary-post\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"glossary-post__overlay-link sr-only-stretched\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/payline\\\" aria-label=\\\"Payline\\\"><\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__title__tax\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__title\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/payline\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tPayline\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"glossary-post__tax\\\">Games and Mechanics<\\/span>\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__excerpt\\\"><p>A payline is the line on a slot game where matching symbols must land to create a win. Wins are paid when specific symbol patterns appear along these lines.<\\/p><\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__more\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"btn--learn-more\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/payline\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tLearn more\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t<\\/article>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<article class=\\\"glossary-post\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"glossary-post__overlay-link sr-only-stretched\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/payment-gateway\\\" aria-label=\\\"Payment gateway\\\"><\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__title__tax\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__title\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/payment-gateway\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tPayment gateway\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"glossary-post__tax\\\">Payments and Security<\\/span>\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__excerpt\\\"><p>A payment gateway is a secure tool that manages transfers of money to and from player accounts. It ensures safe processing of deposits and withdrawals while supporting such options as bank payments, credit cards, and digital wallets.<\\/p><\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__more\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"btn--learn-more\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/payment-gateway\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tLearn more\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t<\\/article>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<article class=\\\"glossary-post\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"glossary-post__overlay-link sr-only-stretched\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/player-lifetime-value-ltv\\\" aria-label=\\\"Player lifetime value (LTV)\\\"><\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__title__tax\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__title\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/player-lifetime-value-ltv\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tPlayer lifetime value (LTV)\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"glossary-post__tax\\\">Financial Terms and Metrics<\\/span>\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__excerpt\\\"><p>Player lifetime value (LTV) is a way to estimate how much a single player will spend during their entire time on the site. It helps casinos understand player worth and guide their retention and marketing strategies.<\\/p><\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__more\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"btn--learn-more\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/player-lifetime-value-ltv\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tLearn more\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t<\\/article>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<article class=\\\"glossary-post\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"glossary-post__overlay-link sr-only-stretched\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/player-retention\\\" aria-label=\\\"Player retention\\\"><\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__title__tax\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__title\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/player-retention\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tPlayer retention\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"glossary-post__tax\\\">Marketing and Retention<\\/span>\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__excerpt\\\"><p>Player retention is the process of keeping players active and coming back to a gambling site over time. It focuses on making sure users enjoy their experience so they continue to play after signing up. This can be done through bonuses, loyalty programs, fresh content, and good customer support. Strong player retention means users stay engaged longer, which helps the platform grow.<\\/p><\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__more\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"btn--learn-more\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/player-retention\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tLearn more\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t<\\/article>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<article class=\\\"glossary-post\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"glossary-post__overlay-link sr-only-stretched\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/poker\\\" aria-label=\\\"Poker\\\"><\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__title__tax\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__title\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/poker\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tPoker\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"glossary-post__tax\\\">Games and Mechanics<\\/span>\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__excerpt\\\"><p>Poker is a card game where players try to create the strongest combination of cards or use smart betting to win chips from others. It involves both chance and skill, requiring players to read their opponents and make strategic decisions. Video poker merges traditional poker rules with electronic gaming features, with games like Texas Hold\\u2019em being widely enjoyed by players around the world.<\\/p><\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__more\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"btn--learn-more\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/poker\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tLearn more\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t<\\/article>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<article class=\\\"glossary-post\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"glossary-post__overlay-link sr-only-stretched\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/progressive-slots\\\" aria-label=\\\"Progressive slots\\\"><\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__title__tax\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__title\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/progressive-slots\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tProgressive slots\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"glossary-post__tax\\\">Games and Mechanics<\\/span>\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__excerpt\\\"><p>In progressive slots, the top prize increases step by step as more players spin the reels. Each spin contributes a small portion to a shared jackpot, which continues to grow until someone wins it. These games can be linked across multiple casinos, making the top prize much bigger than in standard slot machines.<\\/p><\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__more\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"btn--learn-more\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/progressive-slots\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tLearn more\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t<\\/article>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<article class=\\\"glossary-post hidden-post\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"glossary-post__overlay-link sr-only-stretched\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/provably-fair\\\" aria-label=\\\"Provably fair\\\"><\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__title__tax\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__title\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/provably-fair\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tProvably fair\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"glossary-post__tax\\\">Games and Mechanics<\\/span>\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__excerpt\\\"><p>Provably fair lets players confirm that each game round was honest and not manipulated. A provably fair system works by sharing coded data before and after each game, so players can verify the results themselves. This approach lets players feel more in charge and confident, especially in crypto casinos where transparency is crucial.<\\/p><\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__more\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"btn--learn-more\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/provably-fair\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tLearn more\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t<\\/article>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<article class=\\\"glossary-post hidden-post\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"glossary-post__overlay-link sr-only-stretched\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/psp-payment-service-provider\\\" aria-label=\\\"PSP (Payment Service Provider)\\\"><\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__title__tax\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__title\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/psp-payment-service-provider\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tPSP (Payment Service Provider)\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"glossary-post__tax\\\">Payments and Security<\\/span>\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__excerpt\\\"><p>A PSP, or Payment Service Provider, is a company that handles online payments between players and gambling platforms. It processes deposits, withdrawals, and sometimes currency conversions, making money transfers safe and smooth. In iGaming, a PSP helps connect the casino with banks, cards, and e-wallets, so players can easily fund their accounts or collect winnings.<\\/p><\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__more\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"btn--learn-more\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/psp-payment-service-provider\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tLearn more\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t<\\/article>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<button class=\\\"btn load-more-btn\\\" data-total=\\\"9\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tSHOW MORE\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/button>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-group hidden-group\\\" id=\\\"glossary-q\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-term-title h2\\\">Q<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-posts\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<article class=\\\"glossary-post\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"glossary-post__overlay-link sr-only-stretched\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/quickspin\\\" aria-label=\\\"Quickspin\\\"><\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__title__tax\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__title\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/quickspin\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tQuickspin\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"glossary-post__tax\\\">Games and Mechanics<\\/span>\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__excerpt\\\"><p>Quickspin is a feature in online slots that makes the reels stop faster than usual. It shortens the time between spins, letting players play more rounds in less time. This option doesn\\u2019t change the odds or the results. It just speeds up the gameplay for those who prefer a faster pace.<\\/p><\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__more\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"btn--learn-more\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/quickspin\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tLearn more\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t<\\/article>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-group hidden-group\\\" id=\\\"glossary-r\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-term-title h2\\\">R<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-posts\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<article class=\\\"glossary-post\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"glossary-post__overlay-link sr-only-stretched\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/random-number-generator-rng\\\" aria-label=\\\"Random number generator (RNG)\\\"><\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__title__tax\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__title\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/random-number-generator-rng\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tRandom number generator (RNG)\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"glossary-post__tax\\\">Games and Mechanics<\\/span>\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__excerpt\\\"><p>A random number generator is a computer program that produces completely unpredictable results in gambling solutions. It decides what symbols appear, which cards are dealt, or the outcome of each bet without any pattern. In RNG gaming, this ensures every game is honest and that users have a genuine chance of winning every time they play.<\\/p><\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__more\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"btn--learn-more\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/random-number-generator-rng\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tLearn more\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t<\\/article>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<article class=\\\"glossary-post\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"glossary-post__overlay-link sr-only-stretched\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/reels\\\" aria-label=\\\"Reels\\\"><\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__title__tax\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__title\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/reels\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tReels\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"glossary-post__tax\\\">Games and Mechanics<\\/span>\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__excerpt\\\"><p>Reels are the core moving parts of a slot game, consisting of vertical columns that rotate independently to reveal a random set of symbols. The result of each spin is determined by the alignment of these symbols across designated paylines. Though traditionally, slots have three or five reels, modern designs sometimes experiment with more complex reel structures to create unique gameplay experiences.<\\/p><\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__more\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"btn--learn-more\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/reels\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tLearn more\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t<\\/article>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<article class=\\\"glossary-post\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"glossary-post__overlay-link sr-only-stretched\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/refer-a-friend-bonus\\\" aria-label=\\\"Refer-a-friend bonus\\\"><\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__title__tax\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__title\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/refer-a-friend-bonus\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tRefer-a-friend bonus\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"glossary-post__tax\\\">Bonuses and Promotions<\\/span>\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__excerpt\\\"><p>A refer-a-friend bonus is a special reward given to players who bring new people to an online gambling site. When someone signs up using a player\\u2019s invitation and meets certain rules, both get extra perks like free bets or bonus money. This system helps casinos attract more players through trusted recommendations.<\\/p><\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__more\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"btn--learn-more\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/refer-a-friend-bonus\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tLearn more\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t<\\/article>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<article class=\\\"glossary-post\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"glossary-post__overlay-link sr-only-stretched\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/regulated-market\\\" aria-label=\\\"Regulated market\\\"><\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__title__tax\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__title\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/regulated-market\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tRegulated market\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"glossary-post__tax\\\">Basics of IGaming and Business Models<\\/span>\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__excerpt\\\"><p>In a regulated market, online gambling must meet legal standards set by the government. Operators must follow strict guidelines to legally offer games and look after players\\u2019 safety. These standards make sure gameplay is honest, transactions are protected, and players have access to help.<\\/p><\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__more\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"btn--learn-more\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/regulated-market\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tLearn more\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t<\\/article>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<article class=\\\"glossary-post\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"glossary-post__overlay-link sr-only-stretched\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/reload-bonus\\\" aria-label=\\\"Reload bonus\\\"><\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__title__tax\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__title\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/reload-bonus\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tReload bonus\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"glossary-post__tax\\\">Bonuses and Promotions<\\/span>\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__excerpt\\\"><p>After the first deposit, players can get a reload bonus when they add more funds. This bonus offers extra money or spins to motivate players to stay active. Unlike welcome offers, reload bonuses are aimed at returning players.<\\/p><\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__more\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"btn--learn-more\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/reload-bonus\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tLearn more\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t<\\/article>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<article class=\\\"glossary-post\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"glossary-post__overlay-link sr-only-stretched\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/responsible-gaming\\\" aria-label=\\\"Responsible gaming\\\"><\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__title__tax\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__title\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/responsible-gaming\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tResponsible gaming\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"glossary-post__tax\\\">Players and Their Behavior<\\/span>\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__excerpt\\\"><p>Responsible gaming is a practice that encourages players to engage with gambling in a balanced and mindful way. It emphasizes self-awareness, setting personal limits, and recognizing signs of problem gambling early. The goal is to ensure that gambling remains an enjoyable activity without negatively impacting a player\\u2019s life, supported by tools and policies designed to promote healthy play habits.<\\/p><\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__more\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"btn--learn-more\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/responsible-gaming\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tLearn more\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t<\\/article>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<article class=\\\"glossary-post\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"glossary-post__overlay-link sr-only-stretched\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/revenue-share-ggy-gross-gaming-yield\\\" aria-label=\\\"Revenue share GGY (Gross Gaming Yield)\\\"><\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__title__tax\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__title\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/revenue-share-ggy-gross-gaming-yield\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tRevenue share GGY (Gross Gaming Yield)\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"glossary-post__tax\\\">Financial Terms and Metrics<\\/span>\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__excerpt\\\"><p>Revenue share GGY, or Gross Gaming Yield, is a way of dividing income between partners in the gambling industry, often used in affiliate or B2B deals. It\\u2019s based on the total money players lose (bets minus winnings), before deducting costs like bonuses or fees. In a revenue share model, partners earn a percentage of this amount, meaning their earnings grow as player activity increases.<\\/p><\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__more\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"btn--learn-more\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/revenue-share-ggy-gross-gaming-yield\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tLearn more\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t<\\/article>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<article class=\\\"glossary-post hidden-post\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"glossary-post__overlay-link sr-only-stretched\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/roulette\\\" aria-label=\\\"Roulette\\\"><\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__title__tax\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__title\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/roulette\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tRoulette\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"glossary-post__tax\\\">Games and Mechanics<\\/span>\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__excerpt\\\"><p>Roulette is a game of chance involving a rotating wheel segmented into numbered slots, each with a distinct color. Players wager on the ball\\u2019s final position, selecting from individual numbers, colors, or sections. Available in both brick-and-mortar and online casinos, roulette offers a blend of randomness and strategy, with varied betting possibilities that cater to different risk preferences and gameplay styles.<\\/p><\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__more\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"btn--learn-more\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/roulette\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tLearn more\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t<\\/article>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<article class=\\\"glossary-post hidden-post\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"glossary-post__overlay-link sr-only-stretched\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/rtp-return-to-player\\\" aria-label=\\\"RTP (Return to Player)\\\"><\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__title__tax\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__title\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/rtp-return-to-player\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tRTP (Return to Player)\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"glossary-post__tax\\\">Games and Mechanics<\\/span>\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__excerpt\\\"><p>RTP stands for Return to Player and reflects the long-term payout percentage of a casino game. It estimates how much of the total wagered money the game returns to players over time. For instance, an RTP of 97% means the game retains 3% as house edge. The RTP casino meaning isn\\u2019t about individual wins but rather statistical performance across many rounds, offering insight into a game\\u2019s design balance.<\\/p><\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__more\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"btn--learn-more\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/rtp-return-to-player\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tLearn more\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t<\\/article>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<button class=\\\"btn load-more-btn\\\" data-total=\\\"9\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tSHOW MORE\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/button>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-group hidden-group\\\" id=\\\"glossary-s\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-term-title h2\\\">S<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-posts\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<article class=\\\"glossary-post\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"glossary-post__overlay-link sr-only-stretched\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/scatter-symbol\\\" aria-label=\\\"Scatter symbol\\\"><\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__title__tax\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__title\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/scatter-symbol\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tScatter symbol\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"glossary-post__tax\\\">Games and Mechanics<\\/span>\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__excerpt\\\"><p>The scatter symbol is a game element in slots that functions outside the rules of paylines. Its impact lies in presence, not position. If enough appear anywhere on the reels, they can unlock features like free spins and bonus games. Unlike standard symbols, scatters act as event triggers, introducing conditional outcomes that change gameplay flow and can significantly affect player progression and reward potential.<\\/p><\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__more\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"btn--learn-more\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/scatter-symbol\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tLearn more\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t<\\/article>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<article class=\\\"glossary-post\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"glossary-post__overlay-link sr-only-stretched\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/scratch-cards\\\" aria-label=\\\"Scratch cards\\\"><\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__title__tax\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__title\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/scratch-cards\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tScratch cards\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"glossary-post__tax\\\">Games and Mechanics<\\/span>\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__excerpt\\\"><p>Scratch cards are fixed-odds games built on concealed outcomes, typically revealed by removing a surface layer, physically or digitally. Each card holds a predetermined result, meaning there\\u2019s no strategy involved, only pure chance. In online formats, this \\u201cscratch\\u201d action is simulated, often enhanced with themes or animations. Their appeal lies in immediate resolution and compact structure, offering a streamlined gambling experience distinct from extended-play casino games.<\\/p><\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__more\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"btn--learn-more\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/scratch-cards\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tLearn more\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t<\\/article>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<article class=\\\"glossary-post\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"glossary-post__overlay-link sr-only-stretched\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/slots\\\" aria-label=\\\"Slots\\\"><\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__title__tax\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__title\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/slots\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tSlots\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"glossary-post__tax\\\">Games and Mechanics<\\/span>\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__excerpt\\\"><p>Slots are games built around spinning reels that display symbols in random combinations. When the reels stop, matching certain patterns across paylines can lead to a win. Found in both physical machines and online platforms, slots vary in themes, rules, and features, like wilds, scatters, and bonus rounds. Their simplicity, speed, and variety make them a core part of the iGaming world, appealing to many types of players.<\\/p><\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__more\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"btn--learn-more\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/slots\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tLearn more\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t<\\/article>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<article class=\\\"glossary-post\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"glossary-post__overlay-link sr-only-stretched\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/sportsbook\\\" aria-label=\\\"Sportsbook\\\"><\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__title__tax\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__title\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/sportsbook\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tSportsbook\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"glossary-post__tax\\\">Sport Betting<\\/span>\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__excerpt\\\"><p>A sportsbook is a platform where users bet on sports outcomes. It calculates odds, takes wagers, and pays out based on results.<\\/p><\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__more\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"btn--learn-more\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/sportsbook\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tLearn more\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t<\\/article>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<article class=\\\"glossary-post\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"glossary-post__overlay-link sr-only-stretched\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/stake\\\" aria-label=\\\"Stake\\\"><\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__title__tax\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__title\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/stake\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tStake\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"glossary-post__tax\\\">Financial Terms and Metrics<\\/span>\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__excerpt\\\"><p>In betting, the stake is the money risked on one outcome, chosen by the player before the game or event begins.<\\/p><\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__more\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"btn--learn-more\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/stake\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tLearn more\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t<\\/article>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<article class=\\\"glossary-post\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"glossary-post__overlay-link sr-only-stretched\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/sweepstakes-gaming-systems\\\" aria-label=\\\"Sweepstakes gaming systems\\\"><\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__title__tax\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__title\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/sweepstakes-gaming-systems\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tSweepstakes gaming systems\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"glossary-post__tax\\\">Games and Mechanics<\\/span>\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__excerpt\\\"><p>Sweepstakes gaming systems are platforms where players enter contests or games by purchasing virtual currency or tokens that also grant chances to win prizes. These systems combine entertainment with promotional sweepstakes, allowing participation without direct wagers on outcomes.<\\/p><\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__more\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"btn--learn-more\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/sweepstakes-gaming-systems\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tLearn more\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t<\\/article>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-group hidden-group\\\" id=\\\"glossary-t\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-term-title h2\\\">T<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-posts\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<article class=\\\"glossary-post\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"glossary-post__overlay-link sr-only-stretched\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/table-games\\\" aria-label=\\\"Table games\\\"><\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__title__tax\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__title\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/table-games\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tTable games\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"glossary-post__tax\\\">Games and Mechanics<\\/span>\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__excerpt\\\"><p>Casino table games are games played on a flat surface, often involving cards, dice, or roulette wheels. Relying on strategy, chance, or a mix of both to win, players face off against each other or the house.<\\/p><\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__more\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"btn--learn-more\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/table-games\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tLearn more\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t<\\/article>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<article class=\\\"glossary-post\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"glossary-post__overlay-link sr-only-stretched\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/telegram-gambling\\\" aria-label=\\\"Telegram gambling\\\"><\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__title__tax\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__title\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/telegram-gambling\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tTelegram gambling\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"glossary-post__tax\\\">Games and Mechanics<\\/span>\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__excerpt\\\"><p>Telegram gambling refers to placing bets or playing betting games through the Telegram messaging app. It uses bots or channels to facilitate wagers, provide odds, and handle payouts within the platform\\u2019s chat environment.<\\/p><\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__more\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"btn--learn-more\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/telegram-gambling\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tLearn more\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t<\\/article>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<article class=\\\"glossary-post\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"glossary-post__overlay-link sr-only-stretched\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/total-win\\\" aria-label=\\\"Total win\\\"><\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__title__tax\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__title\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/total-win\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tTotal win\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"glossary-post__tax\\\">Financial Terms and Metrics<\\/span>\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__excerpt\\\"><p>Total win is the full amount of money a player earns from a successful bet or game round, including the original stake plus any winnings. It reflects the complete payout received after the outcome is determined.<\\/p><\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__more\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"btn--learn-more\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/total-win\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tLearn more\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t<\\/article>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<article class=\\\"glossary-post\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"glossary-post__overlay-link sr-only-stretched\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/turnkey-gambling-solution\\\" aria-label=\\\"Turnkey gambling solution\\\"><\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__title__tax\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__title\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/turnkey-gambling-solution\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tTurnkey gambling solution\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"glossary-post__tax\\\">Basics of IGaming and Business Models<\\/span>\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__excerpt\\\"><p>A turnkey solution in iGaming is a complete package to start an online gambling site, but it usually offers more flexibility than a white-label iGaming solution. With a turnkey gambling solution, the business often has more control over customization, features, and operations. It\\u2019s a full system set up and ready to go, but much of the management might fall to the operator.<\\/p><\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__more\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"btn--learn-more\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/turnkey-gambling-solution\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tLearn more\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t<\\/article>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-group hidden-group\\\" id=\\\"glossary-v\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-term-title h2\\\">V<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-posts\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<article class=\\\"glossary-post\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"glossary-post__overlay-link sr-only-stretched\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/vigorish\\\" aria-label=\\\"Vigorish\\\"><\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__title__tax\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__title\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/vigorish\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tVigorish\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"glossary-post__tax\\\">Sport Betting<\\/span>\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__excerpt\\\"><p>Before placing bets, it\\u2019s useful to understand what is vigorish and its role in setting odds. Vigorish, also known as \\u201cvig\\u201d or \\u201cjuice,\\u201d is the commission that a bookmaker charges on bets. It is the percentage or fee included in the betting odds to ensure the bookmaker makes a profit regardless of the event\\u2019s result.<\\/p><\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__more\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"btn--learn-more\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/vigorish\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tLearn more\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t<\\/article>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<article class=\\\"glossary-post\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"glossary-post__overlay-link sr-only-stretched\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/vip-bonus\\\" aria-label=\\\"VIP bonus\\\"><\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__title__tax\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__title\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/vip-bonus\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tVIP bonus\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"glossary-post__tax\\\">Bonuses and Promotions<\\/span>\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__excerpt\\\"><p>A VIP bonus is given to top players as a thank-you, providing exclusive perks such as higher bonus amounts, money back on losses, or personalized rewards to enhance their play.<\\/p><\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__more\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"btn--learn-more\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/vip-bonus\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tLearn more\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t<\\/article>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<article class=\\\"glossary-post\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"glossary-post__overlay-link sr-only-stretched\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/vip-program\\\" aria-label=\\\"VIP program\\\"><\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__title__tax\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__title\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/vip-program\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tVIP program\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"glossary-post__tax\\\">Marketing and Retention<\\/span>\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__excerpt\\\"><p>A VIP program is an exclusive loyalty scheme designed to reward top-tier players with special benefits like personalized offers, faster withdrawals, and dedicated support. It aims to enhance player retention by providing unique incentives and elevated experiences.<\\/p><\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__more\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"btn--learn-more\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/vip-program\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tLearn more\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t<\\/article>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<article class=\\\"glossary-post\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"glossary-post__overlay-link sr-only-stretched\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/volatility\\\" aria-label=\\\"Volatility\\\"><\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__title__tax\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__title\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/volatility\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tVolatility\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"glossary-post__tax\\\">Games and Mechanics<\\/span>\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__excerpt\\\"><p>Volatility in iGaming refers to how often and how much a slot or game pays out. When talking about volatility level slots, it means the risk involved in playing them. High-volatility slots pay out bigger wins but less often, while low-volatility slots give smaller wins more frequently. Understanding volatility helps players choose games that match their style and how much risk they want to take.<\\/p><\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__more\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"btn--learn-more\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/volatility\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tLearn more\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t<\\/article>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-group hidden-group\\\" id=\\\"glossary-w\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-term-title h2\\\">W<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-posts\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<article class=\\\"glossary-post\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"glossary-post__overlay-link sr-only-stretched\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/wager\\\" aria-label=\\\"Wager\\\"><\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__title__tax\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__title\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/wager\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tWager\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"glossary-post__tax\\\">Financial Terms and Metrics<\\/span>\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__excerpt\\\"><p>A wager is the sum chosen to be risked on a game or event, where the outcome decides if it turns into a prize or is lost.<\\/p><\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__more\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"btn--learn-more\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/wager\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tLearn more\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t<\\/article>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<article class=\\\"glossary-post\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"glossary-post__overlay-link sr-only-stretched\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/welcome-bonus\\\" aria-label=\\\"Welcome bonus\\\"><\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__title__tax\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__title\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/welcome-bonus\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tWelcome bonus\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"glossary-post__tax\\\">Bonuses and Promotions<\\/span>\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__excerpt\\\"><p>When someone creates a new account, they often get a welcome bonus. This can give them extra funds or free game rounds to boost their first play.<\\/p><\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__more\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"btn--learn-more\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/welcome-bonus\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tLearn more\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t<\\/article>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<article class=\\\"glossary-post\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"glossary-post__overlay-link sr-only-stretched\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/white-label\\\" aria-label=\\\"White Label\\\"><\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__title__tax\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__title\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/white-label\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tWhite Label\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"glossary-post__tax\\\">Games and Mechanics<\\/span>\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__excerpt\\\"><p>White Label \\u2014 a turnkey treasure chest in the iGaming world, where established providers offer a ready-made, comprehensive platform to aspiring operators. It\\u2019s the perfect blend of efficiency and opportunity, where the heavy lifting of software, games, and licensing is already done. The operator simply applies their own branding and customisation, and voil\\u00e0 \\u2014 a fully operational online casino, sportsbook, or gaming platform, ready to enter the market with flair.<\\/p><\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__more\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"btn--learn-more\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/white-label\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tLearn more\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t<\\/article>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<article class=\\\"glossary-post\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"glossary-post__overlay-link sr-only-stretched\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/white-label-igaming-solution\\\" aria-label=\\\"White-label iGaming solution\\\"><\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__title__tax\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__title\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/white-label-igaming-solution\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tWhite-label iGaming solution\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"glossary-post__tax\\\">Basics of IGaming and Business Models<\\/span>\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__excerpt\\\"><p>A white-label iGaming solution is a ready-made platform provided by one company that another business can rebrand and use as their own. The main focus is on branding and marketing, while the technical side, games, and operations are managed by the original provider. It\\u2019s like leasing a fully built casino in which you put your name.<\\/p><\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__more\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"btn--learn-more\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/white-label-igaming-solution\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tLearn more\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t<\\/article>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<article class=\\\"glossary-post\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"glossary-post__overlay-link sr-only-stretched\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/wild-symbol\\\" aria-label=\\\"Wild symbol\\\"><\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__title__tax\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__title\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/wild-symbol\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tWild symbol\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"glossary-post__tax\\\">Games and Mechanics<\\/span>\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__excerpt\\\"><p>A wild symbol is a particularly valuable symbol in slots: it replaces other symbols in a winning line to help complete it. Wilds elevate players&#039; chances of generating payouts by filling otherwise missing paying line elements.<\\/p><\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__more\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"btn--learn-more\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/wild-symbol\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tLearn more\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t<\\/article>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<article class=\\\"glossary-post\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"glossary-post__overlay-link sr-only-stretched\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/withdrawal\\\" aria-label=\\\"Withdrawal\\\"><\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__title__tax\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__title\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/withdrawal\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tWithdrawal\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<span class=\\\"glossary-post__tax\\\">Payments and Security<\\/span>\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"glossary-post__excerpt\\\"><p>A withdrawal at its core is the procedure of transferring earnings from a player\\u2019s account to their bank or other personal savings system. It allows the player to cash out their remaining balance or winnings after meeting any required conditions.<\\/p><\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p class=\\\"glossary-post__more\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a class=\\\"btn--learn-more\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgaming.com\\/glossary\\/withdrawal\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tLearn more\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t<\\/article>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<button class=\\\"load-more-groups-btn\\\"\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tdata-total=\\\"22\\\"\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tdata-offset=\\\"4\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tSHOW MORE\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/button>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\",\"cached\":false}}",
